---
import harbor from "../assets/harbor.webp";
---
<figure class="field-guide">
  <img class="art" src={harbor.src} width="1536" height="1024" alt="A ferry carries three file folders across a teal harbor toward a lighthouse.">
  <figcaption class="shell">
    <h2 class="shell-title"><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#terminal"/></svg>First run</h2>
    <p class="shell-note">Run the installed CLI in your project folder.</p>
    <pre aria-label="Shell commands"><code><span>$</span> ctxferry init
<span>$</span> ctxferry project bind <b>.</b>
<span>$</span> ctxferry context show</code></pre>
    <p class="shell-result"><strong>Expected result</strong> Folder bound. Your new project lists zero documents.</p>
  </figcaption>
</figure>
